{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Glide Reader 是一款專為 ebook 閱讀體驗而設計的應用程式，適合長時間閱讀電子書的用戶。它目前正以限時免費方式提供，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n\n<h2>流暢滑動閱讀模式</h2>\n<p>與傳統逐頁翻閱或不斷捲動文字區塊的方式不同，Glide Reader 讓文字在你的目光下以連續的水平流動方式平滑移動。只需點擊並按住即可開始閱讀，向右滑動手指可加速，向左則減速，讓你直覺地掌控閱讀節奏。應用程式支援匯入 EPUB、TXT、HTML 及基於文字的 PDF 檔案，並提供多種字體、字號、亮度及主題調整選項，讓你打造最舒適的個人化閱讀環境。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1205-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1206-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1207-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1208-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1209-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1210-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Glide Reader</li>\n<li>應用類別：Book</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T14:19:26.046035+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}